# Go build output (module is named "portfolio", so `go build` drops a binary here)
/portfolio

# Business cards: design sources, their rendered PNGs, and the brand art they
# pull in. These are local print/hand-out files, not site assets - nothing here
# is served by server.go or copied into the image by the Dockerfile.
#
# NOTE: og-card.html / og-card.png are deliberately NOT ignored - the OG share
# card is a real site asset referenced by index.html.
/assets/business-card*.html
/assets/business-card*.png
/assets/ax-logo.png
/assets/ax-logo-wide.svg
/assets/stamp-dpi.py
